@title Home-Office Stipend Policy
@subtitle Larkspur Analytics People Operations, effective 2027-01-01
@author People Operations

Everything you need to know about the stipend, so you can claim it without opening a ticket.

## Who is covered

- All employees who work at least 3 days a week from home, after 90 days of service.
- Part-time employees receive 50% of the amounts below.

## What you get

kpi Setup stipend | $500 | one time
kpi Internet and phone | $40 | a month

The setup stipend can be used again after 3 years.

## What you can buy

- Desk
- Chair
- Monitor
- Keyboard
- Headset
- Lighting

## How to claim

1. Buy your items.
2. Submit receipts in the expense portal within 60 days of purchase.
3. Get reimbursed within 10 business days.

!! Purchases over $250 need written manager approval beforehand.

## What is not covered

- Gaming equipment
- Furniture for non-work use
- Software subscriptions
- Anything already supplied by the company

---

Questions? Write to finance-help@larkspur.example or post in the #finance-help channel.
